model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 §4 item 77 (#201): a plain line over a window on some of whose days the sign rule refuses is HOLE-IMPRECISE naming the window (p1; both print 50.00 before 2.1.8); windows each prints the refusal for 03-05 and 03-06 and 50.00 for the rest (p2) (the planner's c5s)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind savings: place PLN min 0
place jar: savings lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input wd: date
input dd: date

move out: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from jar to world amount amt

move inn: transfers
  on dd
  leg cash from world to jar amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  dd = 2026-03-07 "s"
  opening[jar] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask p1: bal(jar, 2026-03-31)
ask p2: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) windows each
ask p3: bal(jar, 2026-03-06)
ask p4: bal(jar, 2026-03-06) windows each
ask p5: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wd = 2026-03-05
ask p6: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wd = 2026-03-08
